{"id":"6bacc140319ebf3e","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-pi11random-kleene.md","title":"Pi11 完整集不可超算术归约到 Pi11 随机点","display":"thm-pi11random-kleene — Pi11 完整集不可超算术归约到 Pi11 随机点","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-pi11random-kleene","aliases":["43-thm-pi11random-kleene"],"display":"thm-pi11random-kleene — Pi11 完整集不可超算术归约到 Pi11 随机点","depends_on":["[[43-df-pi11random]]","[[43-df-hyp]]","[[43-df-pi11]]","[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖","source_locator":"External: Chong–Nies–Yu, Thms.2.3–2.4, PDF p.3; https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf","verification_status":"external-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-pi11random-kleene"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-pi11random-kleene</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pi11random-kleene — Pi11 完整集不可超算术归约到 Pi11 随机点"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bba47d15e357cf58\" href=\"?note=bba47d15e357cf58\" title=\"43-df-pi11random\">43-df-pi11random</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5bdf9b99211ed117\" href=\"?note=5bdf9b99211ed117\" title=\"43-df-hyp\">43-df-hyp</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"689c9916fcffb575\" href=\"?note=689c9916fcffb575\" title=\"43-df-pi11\">43-df-pi11</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"External: Chong–Nies–Yu, Thms.2.3–2.4, PDF p.3; <a href=\"https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"external-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(O\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\\in\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}\">\\(O\\in\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall B\\in\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}\\,\\exists g\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}[\\mathrm{Computable}(g)\\land\\forall n(n\\in B\\leftrightarrow g(n)\\in O)]\">\\(\\forall B\\in\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}\\,\\exists g\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}[\\mathrm{Computable}(g)\\land\\forall n(n\\in B\\leftrightarrow g(n)\\in O)]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O\">\\(O\\)</span> 可取 Kleene 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O\">\\(\\mathcal O\\)</span>；断言只用已给出的完整性假设。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_h\">\\(\\le_h\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5bdf9b99211ed117\" href=\"?note=5bdf9b99211ed117\" title=\"43-df-hyp\">43-df-hyp</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}(X)\\Rightarrow O\\nleq_h X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}(X)\\Rightarrow O\\nleq_h X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>闭合原来悬空的 O 与 ≤h：推广为任意 Π11 many-one 完整参数集。来源证明对 Kleene O 的超算术上锥是 Π11 零类；任意这样的完整集与 O 可计算 many-one 等价，故上锥相同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-pi11random","status":"resolved","id":"bba47d15e357cf58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pi11random]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-hyp","status":"resolved","id":"5bdf9b99211ed117","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-hyp]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi11","status":"resolved","id":"689c9916fcffb575","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pi11]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-hyp","status":"resolved","id":"5bdf9b99211ed117","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$，$O\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$O\\in\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}$ 且 $\\forall B\\in\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}\\,\\exists g\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}[\\mathrm{Computable}(g)\\land\\forall n(n\\in B\\leftrightarrow g(n)\\in O)]$。$O$ 可取 Kleene 的 $\\mathcal O$；断言只用已给出的完整性假设。$\\le_h$ 见 [[43-df-hyp]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"O\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"O\\in\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall B\\in\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}\\,\\exists g\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}[\\mathrm{Computable}(g)\\land\\forall n(n\\in B\\leftrightarrow g(n)\\in O)]","display":false},{"tex":"O","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_h","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}(X)\\Rightarrow O\\nleq_h X.","display":true}],"bytes":1492,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-527","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-pi11random-kleene]] — Pi11 完整集不可超算术归约到 Pi11 随机点"}],"outgoing":["bba47d15e357cf58","5bdf9b99211ed117","689c9916fcffb575","f357216a7edb035a"]}